<title>UK: Four Brent dates kept, one clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>Four Brent dates kept, one clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four of the five Brent crude cargoes turning physical from the paper chains on Tuesday were kept and one was five o'clocked, traders involved in the chains said.</p>
<p>Exxon and Stasco kept one cargo each, the latter holding a combination cargo, and British Petroleum took two. Traders said that JP Morgan was clocked with the fifth cargo.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
